recipes. Make one — or all three — in the days to come.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/01/dining/what-to-cook-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'Dawn Perry makes the case for boneless chicken breasts in three recipes. Make one — or all three — in the days to come.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Dawn Perry makes the case for boneless chicken breasts this week in The Times. It’s a controversial point of view in our thigh-centric world, but it’s powerful nonetheless and, in Dawn’s hands, delicious to boot. Don’t think of chicken breasts as bland, she argues, so much as neutral in flavor, a blank canvas for spices and marinades. Don’t think of them as easy to overcook. Think of them as quick-cooking instead, the perfect partner in the preparation of an easy worknight meal. Yes, there are recipes attached to her argument! Maybe one of them is your dinner tonight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/24/dining/dp-soy-glazed-chicken-breasts-copy/merlin_169351428_b456334d-ef3a-4a2f-abdf-fa1aef96517a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/02/24/dining/dp-soy-glazed-chicken-breasts-copy/merlin_169351428_b456334d-ef3a-4a2f-abdf-fa1aef96517a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/24/dining/dp-soy-glazed-chicken-breasts-copy/merlin_169351428_b456334d-ef3a-4a2f-abdf-fa1aef96517a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/24/dining/dp-soy-glazed-chicken-breasts-copy/merlin_169351428_b456334d-ef3a-4a2f-abdf-fa1aef96517a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subTy