.com/2020/03/02/theater/tumacho-review-the-strange-delights-of-a-supernatural-horse-opera.html', 'snippet': 'Ethan Lipton’s delirious Western comedy features a pigtailed gunslinger, a soul-sucking demon and singing puppet cactuses, among other inspired flights of fancy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some shows play things close to the vest as long as they can, and reveal their intentions progressively. “Tumacho” is not one of them.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/02tumacho/merlin_169898307_00329a44-0dba-4a62-9c40-afce5c72dc8c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'