91320e3-d9b6-503e-8471-deed0f4cebc6'}, {'abstract': 'The case, which concerns a member of Sri Lanka’s Tamil minority, could affect thousands of asylum seekers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/02/us/supreme-court-asylum-habeas.html', 'snippet': 'The case, which concerns a member of Sri Lanka’s Tamil minority, could affect thousands of asylum seekers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In an argument that alternated between constitutional principles and practical considerations, the Supreme Court considered on Monday whether immigrants seeking asylum may sue in federal court after the authorities deny their requests in summary proceedings. The case, which concerns the fundamental question of who is entitled to seek habeas corpus, will affect thousands of asylum seekers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/us/politics/02dc-scotus-immig/merlin_150296598_cac4c7ff-3991-4647-a8b9-45ae51164429-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/02/us/politics/02dc-scotus-immig/merlin_150296598_cac4c7ff-3991-4647-a8b9-45ae51164429-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/us/politics/02dc-scotus-immig/merlin_150296598_cac4c7ff-3991-4647-a8b9-45ae51164429-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/us/politics/02dc-scotus-immig/merlin_150296598_cac4c7ff-3991-4647-a8b9-45ae51164429-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', '