Chips are made from the tree fruit, which is lightly fried in coconut oil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jackfruit, said to be the world’s largest tree fruit, has become an ingredient of choice among vegans for its ability to masquerade as meat, notably as pulled pork in barbecue dishes. But for the new Seril’s Chakka Chips, jackfruit doubles for mango. The crisp, golden, tart-sweet petal-like pieces are simply fried in coconut oil. The company’s owner, Seril James, said he was inspired by snacks his grandmother in Kerala, India, used to make for him.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/merlin_168777582_2d559847-4ac0-416a-956f-064464f00110-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 472, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/merlin_168777582_2d559847-4ac0-416a-956f-064464f00110-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 472}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/merlin_168777582_2d559847-4ac0-416a-956f-064464f00110-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 806, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/merlin_168777582_2d559847-4ac0-416a-956f-064464f00110-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1611, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/02burner-jack-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/02burner-jack-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/02burner-jack/02burner-jack-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Turn to Jackfruit for a Vegan Snack', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Munch: Turn to Jackfruit For a Vegan Snack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snack Foods', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fruit', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Seril's Chakka Chips", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-02T23:52:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac5641dd-8855-5f5d-9912-0d909f85dd73', 'word_count': 108, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac5641dd-8855-5f5d-9912-0d909f85dd73'}, {'abstract': 'Abortion rights advocates had hoped that a top court might legalize the procedure and herald a shift in Latin America. Instead, it left abortion illegal in most cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/02/world/americas/colombia-abortion.html', 'snippet': 'Abortion rights advocates had hoped that a top court might legalize the procedure and herald a shift in Latin America. Instead, it left abortion illegal in most cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOGOTÁ, Colombia — A top court in Colombia declined to legalize abortion on Monday, disappointing abortion rights supporters who had hoped the case would herald a shift in Latin America and encourage other nations in the region to liberalize their laws.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/merlin_169161579_9c2444b5-0792-4707-acbb-754159b820d0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/merlin_169161579_9c2444b5-0792-4707-acbb-754159b820d0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/merlin_169161579_9c2444b5-0792-4707-acbb-754159b820d0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/merlin_169161579_9c2444b5-0792-4707-acbb-754159b820d0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/02colombia-abortion-hfo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/02colombia-abortion-hfo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/world/02colombia-abortion-hfo2/02colombia-abortion-hfo2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Colombia Court Keeps Restrictive Abortion Law in Place', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Court Rejects Bid to Relax Abortion Law In Colombia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birth Control and Family Planning', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colombia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-02T23:54:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Turkewitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turkewitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5e0585d-b06c-5f08-ad09-1c4bd0b62ecd', 'word_count': 906, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5e0585d-b06c-5f08-ad09-1c4bd0b62ecd'}, {'abstract': 'The chef Marie-Aude Rose serves the winter warmer at La Mercerie, and now you can buy the cassoles she serves them in.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/02/dining/cassoulet-dish.html', 'snippet': 'The chef Marie-Aude Rose serves the winter warmer at La Mercerie, and now you can buy the cassoles she serves them in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cassoulet, the centuries-old specialty from southwest France of baked meat and beans, is a cold-weather warmer par excellence. At La Mercerie, Marie-Aude Rose assembles hers with lamb necks, pork ribs, fat back and sausages, nestled in succulently buttery, garlicky white coco and tarbais beans, paved with crusty bread crumbs. It’s baked and served in a deep, handmade earthenware vessel called a cassole, with traditional sloping sides. The dishes are made by the Not family in Mas-Saintes-Puelles, near Castelnaudary, one of the towns known for cassoulet. Roman and Williams Guild, the store that houses the restaurant, is also selling the cassoles, with Ms. Rose’s recipe included on a card.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/dining/04Burner-Dish/04Burner-Dish-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Right Dish for the Cassoulet', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Dine: The Right Dish For the Cassoulet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'v