', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Tuesday, March 3, 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Saturday about the coronavirus and the Zuoling neighborhood of Wuhan, China, misattributed a quote by a local resident. It was Deng Zhi’an who said, “We’ve lost confidence. Nobody in the neighborhood took charge,” not Zhang Jin, another resident.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: March 3, 2020', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-03-03T05:35:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d21b9dc-1afa-57f8-a412-83431e9e5ace', 'word_count': 386, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d21b9dc-1afa-57f8-a412-83431e9e5ace'}, {'abstract': 'Follow live updates as 15 states and territories cast their votes in the Democratic primary, or kick back with a new Netflix special from Taylor Tomlinson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/03/arts/television/whats-on-tv-tuesday-super-tuesday-coverage-and-taylor-tomlinson.html', 'snippet': 'Follow live updates as 15 states and territories cast their votes in the Democratic primary, or kick back with a new Netflix special from Taylor Tomlinson.', 'lead_paragraph': "SUPER TUESDAY SPECIALS on various networks. One of the biggest days in the Democratic primary has arrived. Votes will be cast in 15 states and territories on Tuesday, with more than 1,300 delegates up for grabs. Several networks are prepared to guide you through the evening's developments. At 6 p.m., hosts including Rachel Maddow and Brian Williams get the ball rolling at MSNBC, while the news anchors Bret Baier and Martha MacCallum start coverage on Fox News. At 8 p.m., reporters and anchors including George Stephanopoulos and Nate Silver offer analysis on ABC, while others report from voting locations and campaign headquarters. And over on NBC News, the news anchor Lester Holt and broadcast journalist Savannah Guthrie helm coverage as NBC and MSNBC correspondents on the ground weigh in. ", 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/arts/03tvcol-super/03tvcol-super-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Tuesday: Super Tuesday Coverage and Taylor Tomlinson', 'kic