81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee185210-3d54-5803-90b7-72b3deb5847e'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Times asked the candidates about their plans for housing and homelessness. They back many of the same programs, but are split on national rent control and a renter’s tax credit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/03/us/politics/housing-homelessness-2020-democrats.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Times asked the candidates about their plans for housing and homelessness. They back many of the same programs, but are split on national rent control and a renter’s tax credit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 550,000 people in the United States are homeless on any given night. More than 18 million spend more than half of their income on housing. And there is no state in which the number of affordable homes matches the number of low-income households.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/us/politics/03housing-survey/merlin_169926768_08fdd376-00a5-4aaf-ba19-90c634ad84fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/03/us/politics/03housing-survey/merlin_169926768_08fdd376-00a5-4aaf-ba19-90c634ad84fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/us/politics/03housing-survey/merlin_169926768_08fdd376-00a5-4aaf-ba19-90c634ad84fa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/03/us/politics/03housing-survey/merlin_169926768_08fdd376-00a5-4aaf-ba19-90c634ad84fa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJ