icult questions about refugees and altruism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eleven-year-old Maximiliano Córdoba is full of wondering. He wonders about his mother, who disappeared when he was a baby. He wonders about the stories and legends of his small town, which exists in the fictional nation of Santa Maria, “somewhere in the Américas.” He wonders why his father — a bridge-builder — is so overprotective, solemn and secretive.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/books/review/15-BKS-KELLY/15-BKS-KELLY-thumbLarge-v2.j