w Do They Make Plant-Based Meat Behave Like Beef?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veganism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beyond Meat Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Impossible Foods Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-03T17:43:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. Kenji López-Alt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'Kenji', 'lastname': 'López-Alt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b2a5cc6-ef95-5b59-af99-15863cfaa9d8', 'word_count': 753, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b2a5cc6-ef95-5b59-af99-15863cfaa9d8'}, {'abstract': 'Believe it or not, after 9/11 “America’s mayor” was calm, honest and humble — three things our president can’t manage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/03/opinion/coronavirus-giuliani-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Believe it or not, after 9/11 “America’s mayor” was calm, honest and humble — three things our president can’t manage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday morning, I watched the news conferences held by Rudolph Giuliani on Sept. 11, 2001, when he was still the mayor of New York. Eighteen-plus years later, they look like dispatches from a remote and impossible universe, a place where dolphins roamed the earth and the sun shone pink.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag