9a795dde', 'word_count': 860, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36a11eb4-3669-554f-b990-3dfd9a795dde'}, {'abstract': 'At 56, I now understand how brief his time on earth was. His centennial is a strange comfort.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/04/opinion/fathers-birthday-anniversary.html', 'snippet': 'At 56, I now understand how brief his time on earth was. His centennial is a strange comfort.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My father turned 100 last week. Not in a nursing home or at an awkward family gathering with 1-0-0 candles on a cake. Not in his physical form at all — he died in 1976. But I marked his centennial because, to the few people left on earth who still grieve for him after nearly 44 years, it had to matter for just one day, as just a fleeting number in this life of constant additions and subtractions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/opinion/04belcher2/04belcher2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/opinion/04belcher2/04belcher2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/opinion/04belcher2/04belcher2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/opinion/04belcher2/04belcher2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 1849, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/opinion/04belcher2/04belcher2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy':