all-businesses.html', 'snippet': 'In China and Italy, policy measures are already underway to help, and there are calls for similar moves in the U.S.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the new coronavirus causes workers to take sick days; customers to stay home; and officials to order quarantines, it will be hard on all American companies. For small businesses, though, it could be catastrophic.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/merlin_169991616_c6abdee3-b664-4a83-8703-daf46036c037-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/merlin_169991616_c6abdee3-b664-4a83-8703-daf46036c037-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/merlin_169991616_c6abdee3-b664-4a83-8703-daf46036c037-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/merlin_169991616_c6abdee3-b664-4a83-8703-daf46036c037-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/04up-virus-smallbiz1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/04/upshot/04up-virus-smallbiz1/04up-virus-smallbiz1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL