ances for the Giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. — When the Arizona Diamondbacks met with Zac Gallen late last season to review his rookie year, they issued a challenge. Gallen, a 24-year-old right-hander, had thrived in his first taste of the majors — before and after his trade from the Miami Marlins — and the team gave him a model for the kind of pitcher to emulate: Madison Bumgarner. Study him, Gallen was told, and learn all you can.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/05/sports/05KEPNERdress/merlin_169658628_c02efa31-43a0-4a37-97cf-d8940ebe6381-thumbSt