se dangerous new habit is presented as a way to gain control over her life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s easy to mistake Hunter Conrad (Haley Bennett), the woman at the center of “Swallow,” for a mid-20th-century housewife: She dotes on her husband while wearing pearls and cocktail dresses and has a Jackie Kennedy bounce to her bob. The one deviation is playing iPhone games to relieve her ennui.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/merlin_169651200_a30cb9a8-1eb2-4848-853b-b0f3f92d4136-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 256, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/merlin_169651200_a30cb9a8-1eb2-4848-853b-b0f3f92d4136-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 256}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/merlin_169651200_a30cb9a8-1eb2-4848-853b-b0f3f92d4136-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/merlin_169651200_a30cb9a8-1eb2-4848-853b-b0f3f92d4136-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 872, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/04swallowpix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/04/arts/04swallowpix/04swallowpix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im