 'nyt://article/8f13c49c-89f3-5b61-a8c0-5847ed8deb88'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s son-in-law is divesting his holding in Cadre, a real estate investment venture that sought to profit from opportunity zones, a feature of the 2017 tax law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/05/us/politics/jared-kushner-cadre.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s son-in-law is divesting his holding in Cadre, a real estate investment venture that sought to profit from opportunity zones, a feature of the 2017 tax law.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump’s son-in-law and adviser Jared Kushner is selling his stake in Cadre, a New York-based real estate start-up that has sought to profit from a special tax break included in the package Mr. Trump signed into law in late 2017.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/us/politics/05dc-kushner-1/merlin_169900281_f16dd8b5-d92f-4823-943a-158c46187d10-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/05/us/politics/05dc-kushner-1/merlin_169900281_f16dd8b5-d92f-4823-943a-158c46187d10-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/us/politics/05dc-kushner-1/merlin_169900281_f16dd8b5-d92f-4823-943a-158c46187d10-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/05/us/politics/05dc-kushner-1/merlin_169900281_f16dd8b5-d92f-4823-943a-158c46187d10-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, '