ciated Press was closing shocked journalists, who called it another blow to public interest and transparency in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/05/world/australia/australian-associated-press-closing.html', 'snippet': 'The announcement that the Australian Associated Press was closing shocked journalists, who called it another blow to public interest and transparency in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Australian Associated Press said this week that it will be closing its doors in June, ending an 85-year history in which the national news organization became known for fair coverage and its fast response to breaking news. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/06/world/06australialetter-147-1/merlin_169943490_fa10df78-77d8-468a-90e4-e30fabfe3389-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/06/world/06australialetter-147-1/merlin_169943490_fa10df78-77d8-468a-90e4-e30fabfe3389-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/06/world/06australialetter-147-1/merlin_169943490_fa10df78-77d8-468a-90e4-e30fabfe3389-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/06/world/06australialetter-147-1/merlin_169943490_fa10df78-77d8-468a-90e4-e30fabfe3389-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/06/world/06australialetter-147-1/06australialetter-147-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75