 past wraps the present with its ribbons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/06/well/family/Brooklyn-memories-mother-daughter.html', 'snippet': 'My mother will tell you she doesn’t miss New York, but the past wraps the present with its ribbons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My mother and I returned to her childhood apartment in Bay Ridge, Brooklyn, in 2015. It had been 52 years since she moved away. She will tell you she doesn’t miss New York. She will tell you she has survived because she adapts, and that the past belongs in the past, no matter that I keep telling her the past wraps the present with its ribbons.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/04/science/00TIESHERRINGMOMMEMORIES/00TIE