eading this post, fair warning: although it’s not super-technical, it’s aimed at a very wonky audience, and parts of it won’t exactly be in English. Also, it’s of limited policy relevance: the Trump administration would never consider the policy I suggest, and even a Biden administration would probably balk at going where I suggest. The only reason I’m writing about it is to get the idea out there. Oh, and I don’t think it’s very different from what Larry Summers has been saying, but I thought it might be helpful to put some stylized numbers to what I believe, and believe he believes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBlog/merlin_169973916_373361ff-dbd2-40b8-8da4-88f4d923b2cb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBlog/merlin_169973916_373361ff-dbd2-40b8-8da4-88f4d923b2cb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBlog/merlin_169973916_373361ff-dbd2-40b8-8da4-88f4d923b2cb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBlog/merlin_169973916_373361ff-dbd2-40b8-8da4-88f4d923b2cb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBlog/07KrugmanBlog-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/07/opinion/07KrugmanBl