dential Election of 2020', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klobuchar, Amy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warren, Elizabeth', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buttigieg, Pete (1982- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-07T21:10:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Frank Bruni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Frank', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bruni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e392638-59a9-5673-8e03-5f595dc120ca', 'word_count': 1181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e392638-59a9-5673-8e03-5f595dc120ca'}, {'abstract': 'His insistence that the danger was overseas and could be kept out led officials to downplay the disease’s spread and the need for tests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/07/opinion/trump-coronavirus-us.html', 'snippet': 'His insistence that the danger was overseas and could be kept out led officials to downplay the disease’s spread and the need for tests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Jan. 20, the federal Centers for Disease Control and Prevention found for the first time that the Covid-19 coronavirus had infected an American, a man from Snohomish County, Wash., who had returned from China five days earlier.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'x