 make it in New York. Current and former Knicks say he has what it takes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Knicks rookie RJ Barrett was in the midst of one of the best games of his career and he was doing it at Madison Square Garden against the Houston Rockets, a potential finals team. The crowd ate up his creative finishes at the rim, including one late in the fourth quarter that sent the Garden into a playofflike frenzy of jumping and screaming fans.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_168874224_a6c69392-c54e-48fd-8976-0da3037a2462-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_168874224_a6c69392-c54e-48fd-8976-0da3037a2462-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_168874224_a6c69392-c54e-48fd-8976-0da3037a2462-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_168874224_a6c69392-c54e-48fd-8976-0da3037a2462-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_168874224_a6c69392-c54e-48fd-8976-0da3037a2462-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/07/sports/07nba-knickspicks-lede/merlin_1688742