reet Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/08/arts/dance/oona-doherty.html', 'snippet': 'The Belfast artist Oona Doherty portrays working-class men in her marvelous piece at the 92nd Street Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oona Doherty’s entrance would have been better had it been a surprise; it wasn’t, but it was still a doozy. This contemporary choreographer and performer from Belfast is astonishing — not merely raw, as she is often described, but exactingly articulate. She is in possession of a body with as much flexibility as her mind, as was revealed in her arresting exploration of the young men of her hometown.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1404, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/08/arts/08oona-doherty/08oona-doherty-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei