'}, {'abstract': 'With more than 500 cases in almost three dozen states, officials worry that containment efforts aren’t enough.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/08/health/coronavirus-spread-united-states.html', 'snippet': 'With more than 500 cases in almost three dozen states, officials worry that containment efforts aren’t enough.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the coronavirus gained a foothold in the United States, thousands of employees from Seattle to Silicon Valley were told to work from home. Public school districts in several states have shut down, universities are moving classes to online only, and even churches are limiting services or prayer meetings. A global health conference in Orlando, Fla., planned for Monday, which President Trump was supposed to address, will no longer happen.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/science/08Virus-nation/merlin_170204229_0d89cf90-d237-4816-a884-a62436721293-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/08/science/08Virus-nation/merlin_170204229_0d89cf90-d237-4816-a884-a62436721293-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/science/08Virus-nation/merlin_170204229_0d89cf90-d237-4816-a884-a62436721293-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/08/science/08Virus-nation/merlin_170204229_0d89cf90-d237-4816-a884-a62436721293-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption':