you think your life would be better if you lived in a quiet zone like Green Bank?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/09/learning/how-would-your-life-be-different-if-you-didnt-have-wi-fi-and-cellular-service.html', 'snippet': 'Green Bank, W.Va., is home to a telescope so large that it requires near radio silence to operate, a technological restriction that has created a unique kind of modern childhood. Do you think your life would be better if you lived in a quiet zone ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine if you lived in a place where you couldn’t use Instagram, Snapchat or Facebook on your phone. You couldn’t text your friends. You couldn’t even watch YouTube videos, unless you were watching on a broadband-wired computer. Why? Because you lived in a quiet zone, where Wi-Fi is both unavailable and banned and where cellphone signals are nonexistent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/21/us/00green-bank-youth6/merlin_169281216_2105e1a5-d837-48b3-b52f-e60b1dfece29-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/02/21/us/00green-bank-youth6/merlin_169281216_2105e1a5-d837-48b3-b52f-e60b1dfece29-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/21/us/00green-bank-youth6/merlin_169281216_2105e1a5-d837-48b3-b52f-e60b1dfece29-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/02/21/us/00green-bank-youth6/merlin_169281216_2105e1a5-d837-48b3-b52f-e60b1dfece29-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnai