ization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72efa252-0120-5784-bced-3fc9d3d1a274', 'word_count': 1159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72efa252-0120-5784-bced-3fc9d3d1a274'}, {'abstract': 'He shares the conviction of Gilded Age socialists that values, not economic laws, determine the contours of American society.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/10/opinion/bernie-sanders-socialism.html', 'snippet': 'He shares the conviction of Gilded Age socialists that values, not economic laws, determine the contours of American society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Detractors like to equate Senator Bernie Sanders’s socialism with Soviet and Chinese Communism. This is very 20th century of them. But if critics are looking for a knockout blow, they’re swinging at the wrong century, the wrong country and the wrong socialism.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10White1/10White1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 478, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10White1/10White1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 478}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10White1/10White1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 816, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10White1/10White1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1632, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10White1/10White1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im