times.com/2020/03/10/books/review/my-dark-vanessa-by-kate-elizabeth-russell-an-excerpt.html', 'snippet': 'An excerpt from “My Dark Vanessa,” by Kate Elizabeth Russell', 'lead_paragraph': 'I get ready for work and the post has been up for eight hours. While curling my hair, I refresh the page. So far, 224 shares and 875 likes. I put on my black wool suit, refresh again. I dig under the couch for my black flats, refresh. Fasten the gold name tag to my lapel, refresh. Each time, the numbers climb and the comments multiply.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘My Dark Vanessa,’ by Kate Elizabeth Russell: An Excerpt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'My Dark Vanessa (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Russell, Kate Elizabeth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-10T15:22:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6a264cd-f0cc-59ad-a5ed-7cc70b44e589', 'word_count': 3070, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6a264cd-f0cc-59ad-a5ed-7cc70b44e589'}, {'abstract': 'Pastrami Masters, in Brooklyn, makes corned beef, brisket and pastrami sandwiches. But it also serves the menu left behind by the last tenant in the space, a Lebanese restaurant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2020/03/10/dining/pastrami-masters-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Pastrami Masters, in Brooklyn, makes corned beef, brisket and pastrami sandwiches. But it also serves the menu left behind by the last tenant in the space, a Lebanese restaurant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pastrami Masters, in Brooklyn, makes corned beef, brisket and pastrami sandwiche