 are trying to limit its spread.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/10/us/coronavirus-closings.html', 'snippet': 'With hundreds of cases and more than two dozen deaths from the virus in the U.S., officials are trying to limit its spread.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Isabella Kwasnik, a senior at Harvard College, spent part of Tuesday engrossed in a typical form of college stress: sitting for a midterm exam. But there was something else pressing on her mind. She had just learned she would have to soon leave campus — perhaps for good.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/merlin_170317947_97cfb11a-e34c-4c85-8956-a587f5f49f8a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/merlin_170317947_97cfb11a-e34c-4c85-8956-a587f5f49f8a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/merlin_170317947_97cfb11a-e34c-4c85-8956-a587f5f49f8a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/merlin_170317947_97cfb11a-e34c-4c85-8956-a587f5f49f8a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/10virus-us-schools01alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/10/us/10virus-us-schools01alt/10virus