stories of no more than 100 words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/10/style/tiny-modern-love-stories-our-second-baby-turned-us-into-a-business-partnership.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we met, we were the wild ones. We recognized it in each other. Our nights roaming Los Angeles continued as we pursued our own career paths. Then, our first house, our first baby. I thought I would die from missing our wildness. Our second baby turned us into business partners, essentially, with our communication limited to exchanging information about the children, schedules, bills. Life accelerated; we were stressed and breathless. Until we decided to change everything, to move to the countryside, focus on our children, exist with the awareness that life is a finite gift. What a wild idea. — Maria Coltharp', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/fashion/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/02/fashion/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/fashion/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/02/fashion/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1/02TINYLOVESTORIES-illo1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non