he administration is keeping two written annexes a secret from the American public.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/10/opinion/afghanistan-taliban-peace-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The administration is keeping two written annexes a secret from the American public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why is the Trump administration keeping parts of its deal with the Taliban secret from the public? There’s no point in hiding them from the Taliban, because they have the annexes. The State Department says the reason is to conceal details of military movements from, “for example, ISIS.” But skeptical members of Congress who have seen the documents believe the real reason is that the agreement is so vague on how to ensure that the Taliban are living up to their end of the bargain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/opinion/10taliban_print/merlin_170103648_b5f0925c-b353-46f4-87b9-8e8eaa829200-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/11/opinion/10taliban_print/merlin_170103648_b5f0925c-b353-46f4-87b9-8e8eaa829200-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/opinion/10taliban_print/merlin_170103648_b5f0925c-b353-46f4-87b9-8e8eaa829200-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/opinion/10taliban_print/merlin_170103648_b5f0925c-b353-46f4-87b9-8e8eaa829200-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1350, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't