vernment agencies could be used to get an accurate count without knocking on doors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/11/opinion/contributors/census-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Records from government agencies could be used to get an accurate count without knocking on doors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'America has had 23 successful censuses despite wars, natural disasters, budget shortfalls, political interference and legal challenges. Like the military, the census, the nation’s largest peacetime mobilization, cannot fail. The stakes are too high, its numbers too consequential. It has a constitutional obligation —— reapportionment of congressional seats, and with them Electoral College votes — that underpins our democratic republic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10prewitt/merlin_169360872_d7699bf2-ece4-4ff6-9a91-88ff8a4d1356-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10prewitt/merlin_169360872_d7699bf2-ece4-4ff6-9a91-88ff8a4d1356-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10prewitt/merlin_169360872_d7699bf2-ece4-4ff6-9a91-88ff8a4d1356-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10prewitt/merlin_169360872_d7699bf2-ece4-4ff6-9a91-88ff8a4d1356-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/10/opinion/10prewitt/10prewitt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'