cc018-b063-5aeb-93c2-4d4663478dcc', 'word_count': 517, 'uri': 'nyt://article/300cc018-b063-5aeb-93c2-4d4663478dcc'}, {'abstract': 'Daily life in Italy is now a roll of the dice. Just ask residents of Pavia, once home to a founder of modern probability theory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/11/world/europe/italy-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Daily life in Italy is now a roll of the dice. Just ask residents of Pavia, once home to a founder of modern probability theory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PAVIA, Italy — As his glasses fogged up from the mask he wore over his mouth and nose, Riccardo Rosso, a historian of mathematics, scribbled on a blackboard the possible outcomes of a dice game, substituting the chances of getting the coronavirus.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/world/Virus-Probability6/merlin_169951464_115f69cd-89bf-4b3c-b417-c8f29e2ccd9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/11/world/Virus-Probability6/merlin_169951464_115f69cd-89bf-4b3c-b417-c8f29e2ccd9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/world/Virus-Probability6/merlin_169951464_115f69cd-89bf-4b3c-b417-c8f29e2ccd9e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/world/Virus-Probability6/merlin_169951464_115f69cd-89bf-4b3c-b417-c8f29e2ccd9e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':