lege basketball tournaments look like as the country starts to make decisions about crowds and the coronavirus outbreak? We went to Las Vegas to find out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/11/sports/conference-tournaments-basketball-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'What do college basketball tournaments look like as the country starts to make decisions about crowds and the coronavirus outbreak? We went to Las Vegas to find out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS — Hand-sanitizing dispensers stationed outside locker rooms and along arena concourses. Workers wearing rubber gloves and spritzing hand railings with disinfectant up and down aisles while games are going on. Players keeping a healthy distance — no selfies or slapping hands — from the fans who traveled far to cheer them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/sports/11virus-vegas-1-sub/merlin_170368368_4463ad9b-f8ba-4227-a3bb-ef6c99cec01d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/11/sports/11virus-vegas-1-sub/merlin_170368368_4463ad9b-f8ba-4227-a3bb-ef6c99cec01d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/sports/11virus-vegas-1-sub/merlin_170368368_4463ad9b-f8ba-4227-a3bb-ef6c99cec01d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/sports/11virus-vegas-1-sub/merlin_170368368_4463ad9b-f8ba-4227-a3bb-ef6c99cec01d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '