2020/03/12/sports/soccer/uswnt-equal-pay.html', 'snippet': 'Legal filings in a lawsuit argued women’s soccer players were inferior to men, poisoning an already testy relationship. The backlash cost Carlos Cordeiro his post.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carlos Cordeiro, the president of the United States Soccer Federation, resigned Thursday night, three days after the federation argued in legal filings that “indisputable science” proved that the players on its World Cup-winning women’s national team were inferior to men.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/merlin_170388120_b5203f46-b67f-464d-8258-e95d13efe663-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/merlin_170388120_b5203f46-b67f-464d-8258-e95d13efe663-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/merlin_170388120_b5203f46-b67f-464d-8258-e95d13efe663-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/merlin_170388120_b5203f46-b67f-464d-8258-e95d13efe663-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/12uswnt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/12/sports/12uswnt1/12uswnt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7