8, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b7e551e-26c3-57ff-8798-376c6254b1d0'}, {'abstract': 'Although quarantines are considered a measure of last resort, “police powers” give states, counties and even cities broad authority to make residents stay home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/article/coronavirus-quarantine-questions.html', 'snippet': 'Although quarantines are considered a measure of last resort, “police powers” give states, counties and even cities broad authority to make residents stay home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'States and local governments across the United States have issued some variant of stay-at-home orders covering more than half of all Americans. They range in severity from pleas to avoid gatherings and to stay indoors combined with business closings to mandatory orders with severe consequences, as in Hawaii, where violators face a $5,000 fine or up to a year in jail. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/00VIRUS-LEGAL-korea/merlin_170374020_5f276a67-bf21-45b0-a6cd-d6f243be7ea5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/11/us/00VIRUS-LEGAL-korea/merlin_170374020_5f276a67-bf21-45b0-a6cd-d6f243be7ea5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/00VIRUS-LEGAL-korea/merlin_170374020_5f276a67-bf21-45b0-a6cd-d6f243be7ea5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/00VIRUS-LEGAL-korea/merlin_170374020_5f276a67-bf21-45b0-a6cd-d6f243be7ea5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':