: 'In this stirring drama, the director Eliza Hittman tells an intimate story that is also a potent argument about self-determination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/12/movies/never-rarely-sometimes-always-review.html', 'snippet': 'In this stirring drama, the director Eliza Hittman tells an intimate story that is also a potent argument about self-determination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A low-key knockout, “Never Rarely Sometimes Always” tells a seldom-told story about abortion. And it does so without cant, speeches, inflamed emotions and — most powerfully — without apology. At its most obvious, it follows a 17-year-old as she tries to terminate her pregnancy. It’s a seemingly simple objective that proves (no surprise given the battles over abortion) logistically difficult, forcing her to marshal her modest resources and navigate perilous twists and turns. Here, a woman’s right to self-determination has become the stuff of a new and radical heroic journey.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/arts/13NEVER-RARELY-1/merlin_170126862_0c3b706a-b235-4617-bcf5-33cdd7b644b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 362, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/13/arts/13NEVER-RARELY-1/merlin_170126862_0c3b706a-b235-4617-bcf5-33cdd7b644b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 362}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/arts/13NEVER-RARELY-1/merlin_170126862_0c3b706a-b235-4617-bcf5-33cdd7b644b0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 618, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/arts/13NEVER-RARELY-1/merlin_170126862_0c3b706a-b235-4617-bcf5-33cdd7b64