small and medium-size businesses, but it decided not to cut a key interest rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/12/business/european-central-bank-rates-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'The E.C.B. is encouraging banks to lend to small and medium-size businesses, but it decided not to cut a key interest rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKFURT — The European Central Bank joined other central banks Thursday in taking forceful action to prevent the spread of the coronavirus from undermining the global economy. But the bank disappointed expectations it would cut interest rates as the eurozone hurtles toward recession.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/business/12ecb/merlin_167643141_43d2b230-1007-475b-8237-9531ad37139b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/12/business/12ecb/merlin_167643141_43d2b230-1007-475b-8237-9531ad37139b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/business/12ecb/merlin_167643141_43d2b230-1007-475b-8237-9531ad37139b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/business/12ecb/merlin_167643141_43d2b230-1007-475b-8237-9531ad37139b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/business/12ecb/12ecb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'i