ct': 'The pandemic is a transformative global event, requiring fresh thinking and a public generosity that has not been a hallmark of recent American life, our columnist says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/12/business/strategies-coronavirus-pandemic-different.html', 'snippet': 'The pandemic is a transformative global event, requiring fresh thinking and a public generosity that has not been a hallmark of recent American life, our columnist says.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This time is different.” People always say that as markets spiral, but time usually proves them wrong. Boom and bust, expansion and debt, exuberance and collapse — perspective shows that these are common patterns, as constant as human nature.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/business/15virusmoney-Strategies/15virusmoney-Strategies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/15/business/15virusmoney-Strategies/15virusmoney-Strategies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/business/15virusmoney-Strategies/15virusmoney-Strategies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/business/15virusmoney-Strategies/15virusmoney-Strategies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/business/15virusmoney-Strategies/15virusmoney-Strategies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wi