g your face. It’s another to stop touching the things that touch your face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The coronavirus is here, and it’s showing no signs of letting up. One of the best ways to protect yourself is to keep your hands clean and off your face, but it’s hard to maintain constant vigilance.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/merlin_170417475_501490f3-71f0-4541-a309-3eed98cac2aa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/merlin_170417475_501490f3-71f0-4541-a309-3eed98cac2aa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/merlin_170417475_501490f3-71f0-4541-a309-3eed98cac2aa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/merlin_170417475_501490f3-71f0-4541-a309-3eed98cac2aa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/13virus-phone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/13virus-phone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-phone/13virus-phone-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Clean Your Phone to Help Protect Against Coronavirus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Your Cellphone Is Filthy. Here Is How to Clean It.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hygiene and Cleanliness', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-12T22:24:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Smarter Living', 'section_name': 'Smarter Living', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amelia Nierenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amelia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nierenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a80483a-1976-52b7-9736-78b6ede9087b', 'word_count': 394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a80483a-1976-52b7-9736-78b6ede9087b'}, {'abstract': 'Lawmakers have introduced a number of measures this year, from criminalizing those who prescribe hormone therapy to transgender youth to banning transgender athletes from sports teams.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/12/us/transgender-youth-legislation.html', 'snippet': 'Lawmakers have introduced a number of measures this year, from criminalizing those who prescribe hormone therapy to transgender youth to banning transgender athletes from sports teams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOISE, Idaho — By the time Peyton Badalucco came out to his mother as transgender, he had been secretly binding his chest in a desperate attempt to hide his body. He was 14 years old and so miserable that he could barely muster the emotional strength to leave the house.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/merlin_170033853_490411ac-29bf-4d7a-8709-13d2d9e399ec-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 886, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/merlin_170033853_490411ac-29bf-4d7a-8709-13d2d9e399ec-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 886}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/merlin_170033853_490411ac-29bf-4d7a-8709-13d2d9e399ec-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 694, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/merlin_170033853_490411ac-29bf-4d7a-8709-13d2d9e399ec-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1387, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/12TRANSTEENS-bensons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/12TRANSTEENS-bensons-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/12/us/12TRANSTEENS-bensons/12TRANSTEENS-bensons-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Clash Across America Over Transgender Rights', 'kicker': No