na noticed something unusual among the donations. It turned out to be a print based on Salvador Dalí’s “Divine Comedy” works.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/13/arts/salvador-dali-engraving.html', 'snippet': 'A thrift store volunteer in North Carolina noticed something unusual among the donations. It turned out to be a print based on Salvador Dalí’s “Divine Comedy” works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The frame and images looked old, but there was something about the artwork in the thrift store that struck Wendy Hawkins as remarkable.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 865, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 865}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 711, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1422, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/11/us/11xp-dali/11xp-dali-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Is That a Dalí Among the Tchotchkes?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Is That a Dalí Among the Thrift Store Trinkets?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dali, Salvador', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Thrift Shops', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kitty Hawk (NC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-13T16:14:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4622206-480d-5cb5-b53c-f10d27d496c7', 'word_count': 1049, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4622206-480d-5cb5-b53c-f10d27d496c7'}, {'abstract': 'It will require swift, clear and aggressive action, but the country can avoid a worst-case scenario.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/13/opinion/corona-virus-trump-susan-rice.html', 'snippet': 'It will require swift, clear and aggressive action, but the country can avoid a worst-case scenario.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In times of national crisis, the American people look to our president for leadership and direction. Until recently, President Trump had confronted few, if any, significant national security challenges that were not substantially of his own making. Then came the Covid-19 pandemic, and suddenly the health of all Americans depends on the competence of the president and his team to confront this deadly global threat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '