miologists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/13/world/europe/coronavirus-britain-boris-johnson.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister Boris Johnson has largely kept Britain open, opting for more targeted measures, a strategy that has startled some epidemiologists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Prime Minister Boris Johnson of Britain once said his political hero was the mayor in the film “Jaws,” praising him for defying mass hysteria to keep the beaches open after a constituent is eaten by a shark.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-boris2-sub/merlin_170415015_9a5a5afc-a985-49e2-863f-2a160b83db5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-boris2-sub/merlin_170415015_9a5a5afc-a985-49e2-863f-2a160b83db5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-boris2-sub/merlin_170415015_9a5a5afc-a985-49e2-863f-2a160b83db5c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-boris2-sub/merlin_170415015_9a5a5afc-a985-49e2-863f-2a160b83db5c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1373, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/world/13virus-boris2-sub/merlin_170415015_9a5a5afc-a985-49e2-863f-2a160b83db5c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/13/worl