uring which he declared a state of emergency over the coronavirus. Here are his opening remarks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/13/us/politics/trump-coronavirus-news-conference.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump held a news conference on Friday with health and business leaders during which he declared a state of emergency over the coronavirus. Here are his opening remarks.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Today I’d like to provide an update to the American people on several decisive new actions we’re taking in our very vigilant effort to combat and ultimately defeat the coronavirus.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Transcript: Trump’s Coronavirus News Conference', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Medical Treatment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-13T23:22:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27391e2f-7777-5dc5-bc54-d52bbaaf3509', 'word_count': 1298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27391e2f-7777-5dc5-bc54-d52bbaaf3509'}, {'abstract': 'Some department lawyers expressed worries that the workshops were held to teach ways to limit civil rights protections for gay and transgender people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/13/us/politics/justice-department-religious-freedom.