', 'word_count': 999, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e7ac5d3-4cb3-5b56-9c3e-250675a49807'}, {'abstract': 'To combat the coronavirus, Americans need to do more than secure their own safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/14/opinion/coronavirus-social-distancing.html', 'snippet': 'To combat the coronavirus, Americans need to do more than secure their own safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Social distancing — canceling large gatherings, closing schools and offices, quarantining individuals and even sequestering entire cities or neighborhoods — seems to be the best way to slow the spread of the coronavirus. But it’s a crude and costly public health strategy. Shuttering shared spaces and institutions means families lose child care, wages and social support. What’s more, it’s insufficient to protect the older, sick, homeless and isolated people who are most vulnerable to the virus. They need extra care and attention to survive, not society’s back.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/opinion/14klinenberg-1/merlin_170329191_afbaf9be-8f14-45b8-956a-2ef1e133b1c8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/14/opinion/14klinenberg-1/merlin_170329191_afbaf9be-8f14-45b8-956a-2ef1e133b1c8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/opinion/14klinenberg-1/merlin_170329191_afbaf9be-8f14-45b8-956a-2ef1e133b1c8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/opinion/14klinenberg-1/merlin_170329191_afbaf9be-8f14-45b8-956a-2ef1e133b1c8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1412, 'width': 2048, 'subType'