af-5aa0-aa33-2e917cb57f94'}, {'abstract': 'The authorities said Colten Treu was high on an inhalant when he drove into a troop of Girl Scouts and parents who were cleaning the side of a road in Wisconsin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/14/us/colten-treu-girl-scouts-killing.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities said Colten Treu was high on an inhalant when he drove into a troop of Girl Scouts and parents who were cleaning the side of a road in Wisconsin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Wisconsin man who plowed a pickup truck into a troop of Girl Scouts who were picking up trash on the side of a road, killing three girls and one mother, was sentenced this week to 54 years in prison.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 481, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 481}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1643, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14xp-wisconsin-pix/14xp-wisconsin-pix-thumbStandar