resources as the outbreak escalates. More serious surgeries are also getting a second look.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/14/us/coronavirus-covid-surgeries-canceled.html', 'snippet': 'Hospitals in hot spots like Seattle and New York are postponing elective surgeries, hoping to conserve resources as the outbreak escalates. More serious surgeries are also getting a second look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — Alison Krupnick was mentally preparing herself for the surgery set for early in the coming week that could eliminate her early-stage cervical cancer. But on Friday, she got word from the hospital: Because of the crush of coronavirus patients, her surgery was being called off.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14VIRUS-SURGERY/merlin_170519151_0f7efc52-23be-4d29-b372-589b5eef9ff2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14VIRUS-SURGERY/merlin_170519151_0f7efc52-23be-4d29-b372-589b5eef9ff2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14VIRUS-SURGERY/merlin_170519151_0f7efc52-23be-4d29-b372-589b5eef9ff2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14VIRUS-SURGERY/merlin_170519151_0f7efc52-23be-4d29-b372-589b5eef9ff2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/14/us/14VIRUS-SURGERY/14VIRUS-SURGERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn