ammed together for hours as they waited for new health screenings mandated for travelers from Europe in the face of the coronavirus pandemic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/merlin_170523249_9123c77b-9fd0-481f-ad9d-f5906e9bb7c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/merlin_170523249_9123c77b-9fd0-481f-ad9d-f5906e9bb7c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/merlin_170523249_9123c77b-9fd0-481f-ad9d-f5906e9bb7c0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/merlin_170523249_9123c77b-9fd0-481f-ad9d-f5906e9bb7c0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1526, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/15virus-airports01alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/15virus-airports01alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/15virus-airports01alt/15virus-airports01alt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'ma