n': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24993b0a-c258-5bb0-b618-032862cdf26e', 'word_count': 1154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24993b0a-c258-5bb0-b618-032862cdf26e'}, {'abstract': 'In another overture to the Democratic Party’s left wing, Mr. Biden embraced a version of an idea championed by Senator Bernie Sanders, his chief rival for the Democratic nomination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/15/us/politics/biden-backs-free-college.html', 'snippet': 'In another overture to the Democratic Party’s left wing, Mr. Biden embraced a version of an idea championed by Senator Bernie Sanders, his chief rival for the Democratic nomination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Joseph R. Biden Jr., seeking to shore up support among progressive voters, now backs making public colleges and universities tuition-free for many students, adopting a version of a plan Senator Bernie Sanders has championed, his campaign announced on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/politics/15biden-policy/merlin_170419047_53831442-49d6-429a-ae4e-de42af2f883f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/15/us/politics/15biden-policy/merlin_170419047_53831442-49d6-429a-ae4e-de42af2f883f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/politics/15biden-policy/merlin_170419047_53831442-49d6-429a-ae4e-de42af2f883f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/us/politics/15biden-policy/merlin_170419047_53831442-49d6-429a-ae4e-de42af2f883f-superJu