'}, {'abstract': 'The teenagers went for a swim in Spuyten Duyvil Creek in Inwood on Friday, and family members fear they have drowned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/15/nyregion/hudson-river-missing-swimmers.html', 'snippet': 'The teenagers went for a swim in Spuyten Duyvil Creek in Inwood on Friday, and family members fear they have drowned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two teenage boys knew how to swim, and one, confident he could handle the currents of Spuyten Duyvil Creek, jumped in from a bridge at Inwood Hill Park in Upper Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/nyregion/15river-boys/merlin_140805558_2bc723cb-5aa6-4ab7-9e72-6eaf95dae37e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/15/nyregion/15river-boys/merlin_140805558_2bc723cb-5aa6-4ab7-9e72-6eaf95dae37e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/nyregion/15river-boys/merlin_140805558_2bc723cb-5aa6-4ab7-9e72-6eaf95dae37e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/nyregion/15river-boys/merlin_140805558_2bc723cb-5aa6-4ab7-9e72-6eaf95dae37e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/15/nyregion/15river-boys/merlin_140805558_2bc723cb-5aa6-4ab7-9e72-6eaf95dae37e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'th