ri': 'nyt://article/e2758226-a2ea-564b-94aa-00817fbe516f'}, {'abstract': 'Gun shops and ammunition dealers say they’ve seen a surge in purchases, particularly from first-time buyers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/16/us/coronavirus-gun-buyers.html', 'snippet': 'Gun shops and ammunition dealers say they’ve seen a surge in purchases, particularly from first-time buyers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daniel Hill had never bought a gun before. But last week he was in Larry Hyatt’s gun store in North Carolina, picking out two of them: a 9-millimeter Taurus handgun and an AR-15 semiautomatic rifle.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/us/00virus-guns01/merlin_170367222_6e14b843-304e-4619-afc4-7860fc1a7ca5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/13/us/00virus-guns01/merlin_170367222_6e14b843-304e-4619-afc4-7860fc1a7ca5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/us/00virus-guns01/merlin_170367222_6e14b843-304e-4619-afc4-7860fc1a7ca5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/us/00virus-guns01/merlin_170367222_6e14b843-304e-4619-afc4-7860fc1a7ca5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/13/us/00virus-guns01/00virus-guns01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'i