A few of the hundreds of thousands displaced by the fighting are trickling back. But few, if any, say they believe the quiet will last.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/16/world/middleeast/syria-ceasefire.html', 'snippet': 'A few of the hundreds of thousands displaced by the fighting are trickling back. But few, if any, say they believe the quiet will last.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALYOUN, Syria — Families sifted through the bombed-out ruins of their shops and homes on Thursday in the front-line Syrian town of Balyoun, using a fragile cease-fire between Russia and Turkey to retrieve their belongings but voicing little trust that it would last.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/world/16idlib1/merlin_170451069_fba7ae4f-7051-41f9-9473-630a794c1a90-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/16/world/16idlib1/merlin_170451069_fba7ae4f-7051-41f9-9473-630a794c1a90-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/world/16idlib1/merlin_170451069_fba7ae4f-7051-41f9-9473-630a794c1a90-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/world/16idlib1/merlin_170451069_fba7ae4f-7051-41f9-9473-630a794c1a90-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/world/16idlib1/merlin_170451069_fba7ae4f-7051-41f9-9473-630a794c1a90-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,