ect', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-16T18:29:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8faa2634-b03f-50be-83af-e368ed8ea54c', 'word_count': 1216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8faa2634-b03f-50be-83af-e368ed8ea54c'}, {'abstract': 'On a conference call with the nation’s governors, President Trump said they should try to get ventilators on their own ahead of an expected crush of coronavirus cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/16/us/politics/trump-coronavirus-respirators.html', 'snippet': 'On a conference call with the nation’s governors, President Trump said they should try to get ventilators on their own ahead of an expected crush of coronavirus cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump told a group of governors on Monday morning that they should not wait for the federal government to fill the growing demand for respirators needed to treat people with coronavirus.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump to Governors on Ventilators: ‘Try Getting It Yourselves’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grisham, Miche