s has put an end to movies, date nights and other economic activity, prompting some economists to call a U.S. recession.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/16/business/economy/coronavirus-us-economy-shutdown.html', 'snippet': 'The fast-spreading virus has put an end to movies, date nights and other economic activity, prompting some economists to call a U.S. recession.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In some places, public officials and private business owners moved with stunning speed. In others, paralyzing hesitancy, defiant bravado or blithe disregard dominated. But by Monday, it was clear everywhere that most of the American economy was grinding to an unparalleled halt and would remain that way for months.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/business/16virus-econ-shutdown-01/merlin_170596458_5a828b2c-7a7b-4ffa-a05f-6c7060f2b5ba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/16/business/16virus-econ-shutdown-01/merlin_170596458_5a828b2c-7a7b-4ffa-a05f-6c7060f2b5ba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/business/16virus-econ-shutdown-01/merlin_170596458_5a828b2c-7a7b-4ffa-a05f-6c7060f2b5ba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/16/business/16virus-econ-shutdown-01/merlin_170596458_5a828b2c-7a7b-4ffa-a05f-6c7060f2b5ba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i