 from a prominent family in their Long Island community, and he knew that during the traditional seven days of mourning hundreds of people would be passing through the synagogue where the shiva was being held.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17weiss3A/17weiss3A-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Coronavirus Preys on Jews’ Biggest Strength', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Synagogues', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Neck (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-17T18:58:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bari Weiss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/d833fa78-f5e4-5ab3-82d8-2f86b0814509', 'word_count': 1550, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d833fa78-f5e4-5ab3-82d8-2f86b0814509'}, {'abstract': 'In this webinar, our team provides an introduction to The Learning Network and walks you through how to participate in three of our interactive student features.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/17/learning/on-demand-webinar-how-to-use-the-learning-network-for-remote-learning.html', 'snippet': 'In this webinar, our team provides an introduction to The Learning Network and walks you through how to participate in three of our interactive student features.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whether you are a teacher, a parent or a student who is at least 13 years old, this on-demand webinar will help you get started in using The Learning Network’s free resources for remote learning. We offer more than a dozen new writing prompts and activities each week, all based on Times articles, photographs, illustrations, videos and graphs. All of these prompts and activities are completely free for everyone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-superJumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/10/learning/15remotelearning/15remotelearning-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On-Demand Webinar: How to Use The Learning Network for Remote Learning', 'kicker': 'Professional development', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-03-17T19:01:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Learning', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/711d8