l', 'snippet': 'The Biden campaign and a long list of surrogates are striving to engage progressive Democrats who have so far been cool to Mr. Biden’s presidential bid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Through conversations on Capitol Hill, engagement with local activists and policy nods toward Elizabeth Warren and Bernie Sanders, Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s campaign and its allies are ramping up overtures to progressives, aiming to improve Mr. Biden’s standing with a key part of the Democratic coalition in an effort to unite the party around his potential nomination.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/us/politics/17biden-outreach1/merlin_169778214_58fa279f-a109-4d32-aaaa-0978932423ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/17/us/politics/17biden-outreach1/merlin_169778214_58fa279f-a109-4d32-aaaa-0978932423ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/us/politics/17biden-outreach1/merlin_169778214_58fa279f-a109-4d32-aaaa-0978932423ac-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/us/politics/17biden-outreach1/merlin_169778214_58fa279f-a109-4d32-aaaa-0978932423ac-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/us/politics/17biden-outreach1/17biden-outreach1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {