, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a09a78c1-22da-5956-97fc-e9dce88d026d'}, {'abstract': 'Here are some trends to watch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/17/opinion/coronavirus-trends.html', 'snippet': 'Here are some trends to watch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the coronavirus crisis hit, I was toying with writing a book about 21st-century political parties, but in light of this global epidemic it’s obvious that whatever nonfiction book you’re working on now, put it down. There is the world B.C. — Before Corona — and the world A.C. — After Corona. We have not even begun to fully grasp what the A.C. world will look like, but here are some trends I’m watching.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17friedmanWeb/merlin_170519853_84c6d533-2187-4ff3-8e75-185aac7057fe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17friedmanWeb/merlin_170519853_84c6d533-2187-4ff3-8e75-185aac7057fe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17friedmanWeb/merlin_170519853_84c6d533-2187-4ff3-8e75-185aac7057fe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17friedmanWeb/merlin_170519853_84c6d533-2187-4ff3-8e75-185aac7057fe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/17/opinion/17friedmanWeb/17friedmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75