/ed05dbb9-2a03-5bc0-ace7-24f54c5368da', 'word_count': 3543, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed05dbb9-2a03-5bc0-ace7-24f54c5368da'}, {'abstract': 'Reporting the truth is the only way to stop a global pandemic. Beijing just made that more difficult.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/17/opinion/china-journalists-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Reporting the truth is the only way to stop a global pandemic. Beijing just made that more difficult.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China’s crackdown on journalists from The Times and other American news organizations is an unfortunate echo of the Cold War, and it couldn’t come at a worse time. The global spread of the coronavirus demands independent and trusted information from the country where the scourge began.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/17/opinion/17china_illo_sub/17china_illo_sub-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/17/opinion/17china_illo_sub/17china_illo_sub-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 601}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/17/opinion/17china_illo_sub/17china_illo_sub-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/17/opinion/17china_illo_sub/17china_illo_sub-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1802, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/17/opinion/17china_illo_sub/17china_illo_sub-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c