 Washington star in a new Hulu show. And “Brockmire” returns for a final season on IFC.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/18/arts/whats-on-tv-wednesday-little-fires-everywhere-and-brockmire.html', 'snippet': 'Reese Witherspoon and Kerry Washington star in a new Hulu show. And “Brockmire” returns for a final season on IFC.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LITTLE FIRES EVERYWHERE Stream on Hulu. A regal home is engulfed in flames. Arson is suspected. Who started the fire? That’s the setup of this new series, an adaptation of Celeste Ng’s 2017 novel of the same name. The show stars Reese Witherspoon as the matriarch of a wealthy suburban family (it’s her house that burns) and Kerry Washington as a mysterious artist and mother who grows close to them. The whodunit centers on the months leading up to the fire — an investigation that brings to the surface issues of race, family dynamics and social class.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/arts/18tvcol-littlefires/merlin_169904052_2fb8dfa3-2581-441d-bbd6-dcebeab17b44-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/18/arts/18tvcol-littlefires/merlin_169904052_2fb8dfa3-2581-441d-bbd6-dcebeab17b44-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/arts/18tvcol-littlefires/merlin_169904052_2fb8dfa3-2581-441d-bbd6-dcebeab17b44-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/arts/18tvcol-littlefires/merlin_169904052_2fb8dfa3-2581-441d-bbd6-dcebeab17b44-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subT