or $350,000', 'kicker': 'International real estate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Eco-Friendly Retreat in the Alsace Region', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Alsace (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Strasbourg (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Grand Est (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-18T13:30:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lana Bortolot', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bortolot', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7e7ef0a-9956-5bc0-a236-acfa1a78a47e', 'word_count': 1544, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7e7ef0a-9956-5bc0-a236-acfa1a78a47e'}, {'abstract': 'A roundup of dermatologist-approved (and nongreasy) lotions to soothe dry fingers in a time of assiduous scrubbing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/18/t-magazine/best-moisturizing-creams-lotion.html', 'snippet': 'A roundup of dermatologist-approved (and nongreasy) lotions to soothe dry fingers in a time of assiduous scrubbing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Washing our hands frequently and thoroughly is one of the simplest ways to limit the spread of Covid-19. Hands are responsible for carrying the majority of germs to your respiratory tract, so washing for 20 seconds and paying special attention to neglected areas like nails and thumbs can make a real difference. Dr. Morgan Rabach, a board-certified dermatologist and the co-founder of LM Medical NYC, typically washes her hands about 40 times throughout the day, including, of course, between e