'The president’s invoking of the Defense Production Act could transform American life after the coronavirus, if we get it right.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/18/opinion/coronavirus-trump-war.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s invoking of the Defense Production Act could transform American life after the coronavirus, if we get it right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States can and should “go big” to fight the coronavirus. It has done so before, at extraordinary speed and scale. It has tools like the Defense Production Act to help do it again. And it can be transformative: The industrial mobilization during World War II had a military purpose but lasting economic and social effects, helping build the foundation for a remarkable era of postwar prosperity. To get it right, we must understand how it worked, where it fell short and what the nation needs to mobilize again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/opinion/18omaraWeb/merlin_170408685_f3439d6b-4234-437f-9a58-41740ad84218-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/18/opinion/18omaraWeb/merlin_170408685_f3439d6b-4234-437f-9a58-41740ad84218-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/opinion/18omaraWeb/merlin_170408685_f3439d6b-4234-437f-9a58-41740ad84218-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/opinion/18omaraWeb/merlin_170408685_f3439d6b-4234-437f-9a58-41740ad84218-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt