 pandemic spreading, President Emmanuel Macron has adopted the language of war. Will the land of joie de vivre fall in line behind him?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/19/opinion/france-coronavirus-macron.html', 'snippet': 'With the pandemic spreading, President Emmanuel Macron has adopted the language of war. Will the land of joie de vivre fall in line behind him?', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — With the spread of the coronavirus accelerating at an alarming rate in France, President Emmanuel Macron addressed the nation Monday evening with a call for mobilization. Before millions of television viewers,  he looked directly into the camera and declared, “We are at war.” In 20 minutes, he said it six times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/19/opinion/19Kauffmann1/19Kauffmann1-thumbStandard.jpg', 't