d cancer patient, was released from an Iranian prison.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/19/us/politics/americans-held-overseas-in-iran-and-lebanon-are-freed.html', 'snippet': 'Amer Fakhoury had been held in Beirut on decades-old charges. Separately, Michael R. White, a U.S. Navy veteran and cancer patient, was released from an Iranian prison.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Trump administration on Thursday announced the release of two Americans imprisoned overseas and said it had intensified demands for a third, amid global fears that the coronavirus could quickly spread among detainees and result in deaths.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/us/politics/18dc-hostage/merlin_165480279_18f4943c-e3db-46f9-81c3-d2fb7d0ac87a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/18/us/politics/18dc-hostage/merlin_165480279_18f4943c-e3db-46f9-81c3-d2fb7d0ac87a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/us/politics/18dc-hostage/merlin_165480279_18f4943c-e3db-46f9-81c3-d2fb7d0ac87a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/us/politics/18dc-hostage/merlin_165480279_18f4943c-e3db-46f9-81c3-d2fb7d0ac87a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/18/us/politics/18dc-hostage/18dc-hostage-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumb