ine.html', 'snippet': 'The use of the existing drugs against the new virus is unproven, and some shortages have already been reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump on Thursday exaggerated the potential of drugs available to treat the new coronavirus, including an experimental antiviral treatment and decades-old malaria remedies that hint of promise but so far show limited evidence of healing the sick.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/science/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1/19VIRUS-CHLOROQUINE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Minimal Evidence, Trump Asks F.D.A. to Study Malaria Drugs for Coronavirus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clinical Trials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hahn, Stephen M (1960- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gilead Sciences Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayer AG', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Society of Health-System Pharmacists', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-healthcare', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-19T23:12:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady and Katie Thomas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89ccc695-dfe0-5098-8a9f-16d302ec282d', 'word_count': 1023, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89ccc695-dfe0-5098-8a9f-16d302ec282d'}, {'abstract': 'New filings for unemployment benefits rose