 'value': 'Debussy Rameau (Album)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Grammophon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-20T16:24:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Barone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0c7f8f3-7f9e-513b-8cdc-e1d7952c47f0', 'word_count': 1045, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0c7f8f3-7f9e-513b-8cdc-e1d7952c47f0'}, {'abstract': 'The days we plan to sit down to a meal can be better in these worrying times. Pancakes can help, so can a comforting marinara sauce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/20/dining/breakfast-for-dinner.html', 'snippet': 'The days we plan to sit down to a meal can be better in these worrying times. Pancakes can help, so can a comforting marinara sauce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hello, Five Weeknight Dishes readers. Are we still having weeknights? Is it time for dinner? I think it’s safe to say that most of the daily cues we use to structure the day are out the window. It’s easy to lose track of the hours. But I will also say that the days when we plan to sit down to a meal are better. Cooking is both distracting and nourishing and can take up as much or as little time as you want it to. Our collections of slow-cooker recipes and bread formulas are here for you. But I’m still giving you quick and simple recipes in this newsletter, because cooking when worried isn’t easy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/15/dining/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB/15PANCAKEGUIDE3-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Breakfast for Dinner', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Five Weeknight Dishes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-20T16:30:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Moskin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moskin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/955f9da6-570f-5a60-93f3-e67e22429a7f', 'word_count': 500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/955f9da6-570f-5a60-93f3-e67e22429a7f'}, {'abstract': 'Try ‘spousal distancing’ to minimize coronavirus conflict when you’re stuck at home with your whole family 24/7.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/20/parenting/coronavirus-work-from-home-spouse.html', 'snippet': 'Try ‘spousal distancing’ to minimize coronavirus conflict when you’re stuck at home with your whole family 24/7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember how, mere days ago, the most annoying person in your office was Steve from accounting? It seems almost quaint now. Meet your new co-worker in this surreal new world: your spouse. With many companies having their employees work from home (#WFH) to help slow the spread of the new coronavirus, scores of people are trying to navigate being stuck working at home alongside a loved one.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/multimedia/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/19/multimedia/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/multimedia/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/multimedia/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse/19-Parenting-avoidconflictwithspouse-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1166, '