'She and Mairead Corrigan shared the 1976 Nobel Prize for galvanizing a mass movement to protest sectarian violence during the time known as the Troubles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/21/world/europe/betty-williams-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She and Mairead Corrigan shared the 1976 Nobel Prize for galvanizing a mass movement to protest sectarian violence during the time known as the Troubles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DUBLIN — Betty Williams, a grass-roots activist who shared the 1976 Nobel Peace Prize as a founder of a protest movement that mobilized tens of thousands of people to demand an end to the sectarian violence in Northern Ireland known as the Troubles, died on Tuesday in Belfast. She was 76. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/obituaries/20Williams-01/merlin_160187901_c983be2c-b91a-4df0-bf9b-f7c2fea9d3f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/obituaries/20Williams-01/merlin_160187901_c983be2c-b91a-4df0-bf9b-f7c2fea9d3f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/obituaries/20Williams-01/merlin_160187901_c983be2c-b91a-4df0-bf9b-f7c2fea9d3f4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/obituaries/20Williams-01/merlin_160187901_c983be2c-b91a-4df0-bf9b-f7c2fea9d3f4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1346, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/obituaries/20Wil