.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/22/us/politics/young-voters-biden-sanders.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time, millennials and Generation Z have enough electoral clout to seriously compete with their elders. But many feel more disillusioned than empowered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The oldest of them were just out of college on 9/11; the youngest were not yet born. Over the two decades that followed, they all came of age under storm clouds: of war, of recession, of mass shootings, wildfires and now a pandemic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/22/us/22young-voters-image1/merlin_170221815_6e0d734d-1ad9-4acb-9714-2701ae7bb2db-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/22/us/22young-voters-image1/merlin_170221815_6e0d734d-1ad9-4acb-9714-2701ae7bb2db-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/22/us/22young-voters-image1/merlin_170221815_6e0d734d-1ad9-4acb-9714-2701ae7bb2db-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/22/us/22young-voters-image1/merlin_170221815_6e0d734d-1ad9-4acb-9714-2701ae7bb2db-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/22/us/22young-voters-image1/merlin_170221815_6e0d734d-1ad9-4acb-9714-2701ae7bb2db-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima