” for science, and influenced government science policy with a Washington-based newsletter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/22/science/daniel-s-greenberg-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He challenged peers who acted as “cheerleaders” for science, and influenced government science policy with a Washington-based newsletter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daniel S. Greenberg, a writer and editor who broke ground in science journalism by reporting on the research enterprise not with reverence but with journalistic rigor, died on March 9 at his home in Washington. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 886, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 886}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 694, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1685, 'width': 1141, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/26/obituaries/21GREENBERG1/21GREENBERG1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':