ri': 'nyt://article/7c3c5cbe-26dc-56b5-8124-32401897d38b'}, {'abstract': 'In an echo of 2008, partisan wrangling caused a giant stimulus bill to stumble, even as the market plunged and businesses buckled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/business/dealbook/coronavirus-congress-bailout.html', 'snippet': 'In an echo of 2008, partisan wrangling caused a giant stimulus bill to stumble, even as the market plunged and businesses buckled.', 'lead_paragraph': ' If you couldn’t join us on Friday for our special conference call about the business and policy implications of the coronavirus pandemic, the recording is here. The response was enormous — more than 4,000 of you signed up to participate — so we couldn’t get to all of the questions. What should we cover in future calls? Let us know. (Want this in your inbox each morning? Sign up here.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-congress/merlin_170850207_c19f53dd-557b-4300-88bf-a3e8f7d340f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-congress/merlin_170850207_c19f53dd-557b-4300-88bf-a3e8f7d340f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-congress/merlin_170850207_c19f53dd-557b-4300-88bf-a3e8f7d340f0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-congress/merlin_170850207_c19f53dd-557b-4300-88bf-a3e8f7d340f0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy':