enting', 'section_name': 'Parenting', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Grose', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grose', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac731d69-4b56-5ebf-88c3-a80b0448fb9b', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac731d69-4b56-5ebf-88c3-a80b0448fb9b'}, {'abstract': 'The pandemic is only one of many potential disasters that will require unity of action among the armed services.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/opinion/coronavirus-military.html', 'snippet': 'The pandemic is only one of many potential disasters that will require unity of action among the armed services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump has finally called in the military in the nation’s war against the coronavirus. But precious time was lost in the weeks since he was warned about the dangers the virus poses. We need to make sure that doesn’t happen again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Helvarg/23Helvarg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'We Need a Unified Military Command for Disaster Response', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ARMY CORPS OF ENGINEERS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Guard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Coast Guard', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-23T14:22:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Helvarg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Helvarg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/10b9d136-90ee-53ac-8747-96627639b57f', 'word_count': 950, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10b9d136-90ee-53ac-8747-96627639b57f'}, {'abstract': 'You don’t have to have all the ingredients to follow a recipe, or to make a great meal. Make the recipe your own.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/dining/cook-with-confidence.html', 'snippet': 'You don’t have to have all the ingredients to follow a recipe, or to make a great meal. Make the recipe your own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Took a drive with a kid and a dog on Sunday morning, out to where the people drop away and the oystercatchers skim the shoreline, to where it’s quiet but for wind through the spartina, and the slap of the bay against the peat. We walked in companionable silence. I thought about how you’re doing, cooking every day for the first time in ages if ever, and running into recipes that may call for things like escarole and preserved lemons, crème fraîche, maple syrup, Champagne vinegar. Maybe you don’t have those ingredients. Maybe that freaks you out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/03/20/dining/15Romanrex/merlin_152005611_30054f65-d1f3-4dc8-bb61-5bfdc58f0ecc-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cook With Confidence', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-23T14:35:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/624cc16c-9a54-5dad-9a97-4227eddfcba2', 'word_count': 788, 'uri': 'nyt://article/624cc16c-9a54-5dad-9a97-4227eddfcba2'}, {'abstract': 'In some countries, workers will have 90 percent of lost wages covered. In others, residents fear eviction. Nation to nation, rescue plans reflect conflicting ideas of government’s role in a crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/world/europe/coronavirus-economic-relief-wages.html', 'snippet': 'In some countries, workers will have 90 percent of lost wages covered. In others, residents fear eviction. Nation to nation, rescue plans reflect conflicting ideas of government’s role in a crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a Queens apartment, a laid-off busboy has no idea if he will make next month’s rent or feed his family. An out-of-work waitress in Amsterdam, though, can count on the government to cover 90 percent of her wages. As a Malaysian florist anxiously burns through her savings, cafe owners in Brussels receive about $4,300 to make up for lost revenue.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/world/23virus-workers01/merlin_170845794_af11fd86-57ee-4f9c-b0b5-50a7b224312b-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Covid-19’s Economic Pain Is Universal. But Relief? Depends on Where You Live', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Who Gets Help? How, and What?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AMSTERDAM (NETHERLANDS)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Copenhagen (Denmark)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'KfW Bankengruppe', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-23T14:47:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Apuzzo and Monika Pronczuk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Apuzzo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Monika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pronczuk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc14faef-0907-5f39-b321-b24775eb2b72', 'word_count': 1191, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc14faef-0907-5f39-b321-b24775eb2b72'}, {'abstract': 'Plenty of work can be done from home, but the pandemic is forcing some parts of the scientific process to be put on the shelf.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/science/coronavirus-closed-labs.html', 'snippet': 'Plenty of work can be done from home, but the pandemic is forcing some parts of the scientific process to be put on the shelf.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent weeks, coronavirus led to the shutdown of many university campuses and other institutions for research and learning in the United States and around the world.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/science/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/science/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/science/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/science/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo/23SCI-VIRUS-CLOSEDLABS-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti