': 'nyt://article/fee6a956-8142-5321-82f4-c2c2e72a8eb4'}, {'abstract': 'As an extrovert, being isolated is horrible. But it is a necessary — and temporary — step toward stopping the spread of the coronavirus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/opinion/social-distancing-covid.html', 'snippet': 'As an extrovert, being isolated is horrible. But it is a necessary — and temporary — step toward stopping the spread of the coronavirus.', 'lead_paragraph': '2020 has been canceled.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Edmunds/23Edmunds-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chin Up, Extroverts: We Will Crowd Again!', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-23T19:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Edmonds', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Edmonds', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e8eb612-ea5d-5b0a-97d0-80f3b5ae7a2e', 'word_count': 930, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e8eb612-ea5d-5b0a-97d0-80f3b5ae7a2e'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. López Obrador deserves to be strongly criticized, but Mexicans will have to stand together to get through coronavirus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/opinion/mexico-coronavirus-amlo.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. López Obrador deserves to be strongly criticized, but Mexicans will have to stand together to get through coronavirus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEXICO CITY — On March 4, a few days after the first coronavirus case was discovered here, President Andrés Manuel López Obrador was asked about the infection at his daily news conference. “With the coronavirus, this idea that you can’t hug,” the president said. “You have to hug. Nothing happens.” He crossed his arms and hugged himself, a signature gesture that he uses to show him hugging the Mexican people.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/23/opinion/23Grillo/merlin_170701647_d4589073-2947-40c1-9884-9b502f618af6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'article