'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff820c08-17e8-5ab2-9733-d81605f51708', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff820c08-17e8-5ab2-9733-d81605f51708'}, {'abstract': 'Aneto, from Barcelona, add more flavor to soups and stews.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/dining/aneto-natural-broth.html', 'snippet': 'Aneto, from Barcelona, add more flavor to soups and stews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A line of first-rate Spanish broths (chicken, fish and vegetable for soups and stews, and more focused mixtures meant for paella, specifically seafood paella) is now available. There’s even one for black, squid ink paella. These broths, made in Barcelona, are free of additives and preservatives and deliver good flavor. For paella, I might simmer the broth with a little more saffron before adding it to the rice, and it’s also excellent for risotto.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 771}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 797, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1594, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23Burner-broth/23Burner-broth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spanish Broths for More Than Paella', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Simmer: Spanish Broths For More Than Paella', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aneto Natural SLU', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-23T23:29:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddbfd4e6-7e74-52d2-aa90-a7c93a11cff8', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddbfd4e6-7e74-52d2-aa90-a7c93a11cff8'}, {'abstract': 'New York is more crowded than any large city in the country. That helps explain why it is the U.S. epicenter of the outbreak.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/23/nyregion/coronavirus-nyc-crowds-density.html', 'snippet': 'New York is more crowded than any large city in the country. That helps explain why it is the U.S. epicenter of the outbreak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York has tried to slow the spread of the coronavirus by closing its schools, shutting down i