020.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The parameters going forward have not been determined, but the Games are not going to start on July 24, that much I know.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Joining Athletes, U.S. Committee Pushes for Delay of Tokyo Games', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T04:02:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/eed748dd-e41d-5f62-aa92-0aef807b148d', 'word_count': 38, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eed748dd-e41d-5f62-aa92-0aef807b148d'}, {'abstract': 'Fleeing New Yorkers told to quarantine as Trump says the U.S. should reopen ‘by Easter.’', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/world/coronavirus-news-live-updates.html', 'snippet': 'Fleeing New Yorkers told to quarantine as Trump says the U.S. should reopen ‘by Easter.’', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Expresses Outrage at Having to ‘Close the Country’ to Slow Virus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Birx, Deborah L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations',