n': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd4e655a-b536-5f19-8085-09ad7be29eab', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd4e655a-b536-5f19-8085-09ad7be29eab'}, {'abstract': 'The International Olympic Committee had said the Tokyo Games would offer hope against the coronavirus this summer, even as sports leaders and medical experts insisted that the event be delayed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/sports/olympics/tokyo-olympics-postponed-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'The International Olympic Committee had said the Tokyo Games would offer hope against the coronavirus this summer, even as sports leaders and medical experts insisted that the event be delayed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For weeks, as the coronavirus spread across the world, Thomas Bach, the president of the International Olympic Committee, held on to the dream that opening an Olympic Games on July 24 in Tokyo could serve as a celebration of triumph over a pandemic that has killed thousands of people, closed down countries and devastated the world economy.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/sports/24virus-olybubble/merlin_170873751_1df9fe2a-7c25-4c81-9106-6787c91f7c71-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/sports/24virus-olybubble/merlin_170873751_1df9fe2a-7c25-4c81-9106-6787c91f7c71-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/sports/24virus-olybubble/merlin_170873751_1df9fe2a-7c25-4c81-9106-6787c91f7c71-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '