d-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/12/books/review/Dickerson1/Dickerson1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Is the Face of an Undocumented Immigrant. Don’t Look Away.', 'kicker': 'Nonfiction', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Out of the Shadows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Workers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Undocumented Americans (Book)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Villavicencio, Karla Cornejo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T09:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caitlin Dickerson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caitlin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dickerson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/abd535d5-113a-5859-9179-102694a0f429', 'word_count': 1284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abd535d5-113a-5859-9179-102694a0f429'}, {'abstract': 'At a moment when the present is terrifying and the future is uncertain, we’re returning to the recipes of the past.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/well/family/coronavirus-cooking-grandmother-facetime.html', 'snippet': 'At a moment when the present is terrifying and the future is uncertain, we’re returning to the recipes of the past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my grandmother turned 91 two weeks ago, I called to wish her a happy birthday and we made plans to celebrate over dinner later in the month. But in a matter of days, like everyone else, we saw the world change around us and our plans evaporated. Now I’m self-quarantined in Brooklyn and my grandmother is in Florida. We won’t be seeing each other in person any time soon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/19/well/00well-jaffe/00well-jaffe-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cooking Through a Crisis With Grandma, Virtually', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grandparents', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T09:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Family', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ali Jaffe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ali', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaffe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c848db7-f1fe-58ea-9cc0-8e453e4ff35c', 'word_count': 986, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c848db7-f1fe-58ea-9cc0-8e453e4ff35c'}, {'abstract': 'The single best thing Congress can do to stanch economic bleeding is to enact a temporary national moratorium on small business debt collections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/opinion/coronavirus-small-businesses.html', 'snippet': 'The single best thing Congress can do to stanch economic bleeding is to enact a temporary national moratorium on small business debt collections.', 'lead_paragraph': '[Read our Coronavirus Relief Small Business F.A.Q.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24LevitinKhanna/merlin_170544678_6512753a-1e15-4a27-8b9a-b5b91aa45950-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24LevitinKhanna/merlin_170544678_6512753a-1e15-4a27-8b9a-b5b91aa45950-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 