': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal National Mortgage Assn (Fannie Mae)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T09:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam J. Levitin and Satyam Khanna', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Levitin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Satyam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Khanna', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2202634-5163-5abd-a041-7a49b3f72aba', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2202634-5163-5abd-a041-7a49b3f72aba'}, {'abstract': 'We need liquidity to help businesses and individuals get through this necessarily tough time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/opinion/coronavirus-stimulus-economy-liquidity.html', 'snippet': 'We need liquidity to help businesses and individuals get through this necessarily tough time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite several days of intense negotiation, the Senate has so far failed to pass a bill to infuse over a trillion dollars into the ailing U.S. economy. While there can be no doubt that swift action is vital, too many politicians and policymakers seem to think the goal should be to stimulate the economy back into action.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Lazear/24Lazear-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Stimulus Is the Wrong Prescription', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T09:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward P. Lazear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': 'P.', 'lastname': 'Lazear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b1779bb-4498-5fea-9c7c-69c0e9aaffd2', 'word_count': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b1779bb-4498-5fea-9c7c-69c0e9aaffd2'}, {'abstract': 'When you are quarantined or cancel your trip, you can still go on a journey. The secret? The author Reif Larsen says it’s Google Street View.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/travel/coronavirus-virtual-travel.html', 'snippet': 'When you are quarantined or cancel your trip, you can still go on a journey. The secret? The author Reif Larsen says it’s Google Street View.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The other day, anxious in my desk chair, I became a virtual traveler, staring at photos of public spaces abandoned in the wake of the coronavirus global pandemic: a soccer game in Germany, played in front of thousands of empty seats, the Piazza San Marco in Venice, vacant save for a few confused pigeons, the huge empty courtyard at the Great Mosque in Mecca, usually filled to the brim with worshipers circumnavigating the Ka’bah. These are places built for humans, but there were no humans. It was like peering into what a future might look like after we are gone, a disaster movie without the movie part.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1527, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/travel/29Virtual-travel/29Virtual-travel-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to See the World When You’re Stuck at Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vessels for Virtual Voyages', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Street View', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T09:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Reif Larsen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Reif', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Larsen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfc43d16-5a7f-511f-99fc-d8ef274a8bec', 'word_count': 2063, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfc43d16-5a7f-511f-99fc-d8ef274a8bec'}, {'abstract': 'He already seems to be losing interest. Look elsewhere for hope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/opinion/coronavirus-trump.html', 'snippet': 'He already seems to be losing interest. Look elsewhere for hope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gail Collins: How are you doing, Bret? I haven’t seen you in a while. In fact, I haven’t seen anybody, except my husband, the grocery store cashier and the dry cleaner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24conversation1/merlin_170883876_7cd7ad2c-c2f9-4f5c-8c92-28e1976c15fd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24conversation1/merlin_170883876_7cd7ad2c-c2f9-4f5c-8c92-28e1976c15fd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24conversation1/merlin_170883876_7cd7ad2c-c2f9-4f5c-8c92-28e1976c15fd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24conversation1/merlin_170883876_7cd7ad2c-c2f9-4f5c-8c92-28e1976c15fd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24conversation1/merlin_170883876_7cd7ad2c-c2f9-4f5c-8c92-28e1976c15fd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20