oronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Human adaptability is both a strength and a threat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RAMALLAH, West Bank — As New York City was moving toward a full confinement mode, I got an email from the daughter of a Palestinian friend from the West Bank. She lives and works in the city and was looking for advice from a veteran of long-term confinements. “I was too young at the time of the Israeli military curfew in 2002 to remember,” she wrote, and then asked: “How did you all manage?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1377, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24Shehadeh2/24Shehadeh2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su