', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Medical Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mitchell, Elizabeth L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T15:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Weise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04183e95-e3b1-558f-82a7-65c84a8cae74', 'word_count': 489, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04183e95-e3b1-558f-82a7-65c84a8cae74'}, {'abstract': 'Top Democrats and administration officials said they were optimistic about finalizing a compromise on a $2 trillion economic package after agreeing to add oversight for a bailout fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/us/politics/coronavirus-stimulus-bill.html', 'snippet': 'Top Democrats and administration officials said they were optimistic about finalizing a compromise on a $2 trillion economic package after agreeing to add oversight for a bailout fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON —\xa0Congressional leaders and Trump administration officials closed in on a deal on Tuesday on a roughly $2 trillion economic stabilization plan to respond to the coronavirus pandemic, after agreeing to Democratic demands to add oversight requirements for a $500 billion government bailout fund for distressed companies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/us/politics/24dc