': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/magazine/coronavirus-music-live-stream-concert.html', 'snippet': 'The live performance wasn’t really live, but it felt like being there all the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a bit of a cacophony at first, as conflicting melodies emerged and subsided. This was the chaos of preparation, the warm-up, but after a few moments the orchestra went quiet. It felt like a long, deep breath, and so I took one, too. The graphic advertising the concert as “Live From Benaroya Hall” in Seattle disappeared, revealing the conductor, as he took his place onstage, all eyes on his upheld baton. The music started softly and then grew stronger, filling my living room: floating flutes, a charge of clarinets, the friendly vibrato of bassoons. The strings played a single note, across seven octaves.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/magazine/29mag-screenland-1/29mag-screenland-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/29/magazine/29mag-screenland-1/29mag-screenland-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/magazine/29mag-screenland-1/29mag-screenland-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/magazine/29mag-screenland-1/29mag-screenland-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/29/magazine/29mag-screenland-1/29mag-