avirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-24T23:18:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley and Shane Goldmacher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Shane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldmacher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/175e44fd-4fc6-5b1f-9b4e-3a68471f6a12', 'word_count': 1801, 'uri': 'nyt://article/175e44fd-4fc6-5b1f-9b4e-3a68471f6a12'}, {'abstract': 'He was furious, despairing, yet inescapably entertaining, often in the same show. And he offered memorable roles to Nathan Lane, Zoe Caldwell and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/theater/terrence-mcnally-new-york-times.html', 'snippet': 'He was furious, despairing, yet inescapably entertaining, often in the same show. And he offered memorable roles to Nathan Lane, Zoe Caldwell and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He certainly didn’t shy from work. Terrence McNally wrote 36 plays, as well as the books for 10 musicals and the librettos for four operas. He earned four Tony Awards and developed fruitful professional relationships with Nathan Lane, Tyne Daly and Audra McDonald, among others. Here’s a look at what the Times said about his remarkable output over the decades.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/merlin_154796280_289da09e-3ba4-483b-bf13-416fc710c60b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/merlin_154796280_289da09e-3ba4-483b-bf13-416fc710c60b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/merlin_154796280_289da09e-3ba4-483b-bf13-416fc710c60b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/merlin_154796280_289da09e-3ba4-483b-bf13-416fc710c60b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/24mcnally-critics-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/24mcnally-critics-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/31/arts/24mcnally-critics-1/24mcnally-critics-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}],