 None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 4}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/708a105f-7044-56b2-8819-4037d1cdfbf6', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/708a105f-7044-56b2-8819-4037d1cdfbf6'}, {'abstract': 'Untold thousands will likely die, absent federal intervention. And it needs to happen this instant. Why won’t the president help?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/24/opinion/trump-nyc-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Untold thousands will likely die, absent federal intervention. And it needs to happen this instant. Why won’t the president help?', 'lead_paragraph': 'So it’s essentially come to this: President Trump is treating each of our 50 states as individual contestants on “The Apprentice” — pitting them against one another for scarce resources, daring them to duke it out — rather than mobilizing a unified national response to a pandemic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24senior1a/merlin_170852385_ffa88a0e-88e0-4d31-948b-2aa60b0a8c80-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24senior1a/merlin_170852385_ffa88a0e-88e0-4d31-948b-2aa60b0a8c80-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24senior1a/merlin_170852385_ffa88a0e-88e0-4d31-948b-2aa60b0a8c80-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/24/opinion/24senior1a/merlin_170852385_ffa88a0e-88e0-4d31-948b-2aa60b0a8c80-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy