oom with his name on it. But Bruner’s plan for the afternoon was to stay on the bus, where he feels at home.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 479, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 479}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 818, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1636, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/arts/05thundercat1/05thundercat1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He’d Always Been Thundercat, Whether He Knew It or Not', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Cool Cat, Complete With Courage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bruner, Stephen (Thundercat) (1984- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bruner, Ronald Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Mac', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'It Is What It Is (Album)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-25T14:24:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Pappademas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pappademas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77609028-043e-53d2-967e-9c99fb70626b', 'word_count': 1861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77609028-043e-53d2-967e-9c99fb70626b'}, {'abstract': 'Put your own riff on ingredients, using what you have, or riff on Melissa Clark’s riffs: She’s got five highly adaptable recipes worth your time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/25/dining/theres-no-need-for-recipes-now.html', 'snippet': 'Put your own riff on ingredients, using what you have, or riff on Melissa Clark’s riffs: She’s got five highly adaptable recipes worth your time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. I roasted some black sea bass, the fillets painted with a mixture of mayonnaise and sesame oil, oyster sauce, a dash of lime juice, another of honey. I served the fish over rice with a stir-fry of cabbage and pickled chiles. It was fantastically delicious and required no recipe because I was cooking off the top of my head as so many of us are these days. I just stared into the pantry for a while and waited for the muse to arrive with her gift. And then there it was: dinner, salty-sweet-crunchy-spicy-rich. So great!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/merlin_170847768_788f24dd-b061-491a-b0c0-9072a4111be4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/merlin_170847768_788f24dd-b061-491a-b0c0-9072a4111be4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/merlin_170847768_788f24dd-b061-491a-b0c0-9072a4111be4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/merlin_170847768_788f24dd-b061-491a-b0c0-9072a4111be4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/23mc-pantryrex2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/23mc-pantryrex2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/dining/23mc-pantryrex2-copy/23mc-pantryrex2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'There’s No Need for Recipes Now', 'kicker': None, 'content