Love Came to Kill Us” is meant to motivate people to think about their mortality. Now she’s releasing it during a pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/25/arts/music/jessie-reyez-before-love-came-to-kill-us.html', 'snippet': 'The 28-year-old musician’s debut album “Before Love Came to Kill Us” is meant to motivate people to think about their mortality. Now she’s releasing it during a pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since 2016, Jessie Reyez, a Canadian songwriter whose parents came from Colombia, has built a fervent audience for songs that delve into loyalty and betrayal, ambition and obstacles, heartbreak and vengeance — songs that map the messy, volatile mood swings of 21st-century romance. The 2016 single that brought her international attention, “Figures,” is a ballad built on doo-wop guitar picking that veers between anger and tears; it has been streamed more than 63 million times on YouTube alone.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25reyez1/merlin_170502336_ff8c67b2-2738-4d24-a127-de4f2ecf02ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25reyez1/merlin_170502336_ff8c67b2-2738-4d24-a127-de4f2ecf02ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25reyez1/merlin_170502336_ff8c67b2-2738-4d24-a127-de4f2ecf02ee-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25reyez1/merlin_170502336_ff8c67b2-2738-4d24-a127-de4f2ecf02ee-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cr