r Parity in the Theater', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Julia Miles, a Powerhouse for Gender Parity in the Theater, Dies at 90', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miles, Julia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Women's Project", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WP Theater', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-25T18:51:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel E. Slotnik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Slotnik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/344ca61b-101a-5e76-ba76-54e919fe3fd6', 'word_count': 939, 'uri': 'nyt://article/344ca61b-101a-5e76-ba76-54e919fe3fd6'}, {'abstract': 'Small banks, retailers and for-profit colleges got provisions they wanted. So did Boeing. Among those who could potentially benefit: President Trump’s company.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/25/us/politics/virus-fineprint-stimulus-bill.html', 'snippet': 'Small banks, retailers and for-profit colleges got provisions they wanted. So did Boeing. Among those who could potentially benefit: President Trump’s company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Restaurants and retailers will get a tweak to federal tax law they have been seeking for more than a year that could save them $15 billion. Community banks are being granted their long-held wish of being freed to reduce the amount of capital they have to hold in reserve.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/merlin_140689365_bc977b1a-eb5d-4a2e-b2f4-49722198cbdf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/merlin_140689365_bc977b1a-eb5d-4a2e-b2f4-49722198cbdf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/merlin_140689365_bc977b1a-eb5d-4a2e-b2f4-49722198cbdf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/merlin_140689365_bc977b1a-eb5d-4a2e-b2f4-49722198cbdf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/25dc-virus-fineprint1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/25dc-virus-fineprint1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/us/politics/25dc-virus-fineprint1/25dc-virus-fineprint1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}],