or who came to know “he didn’t have to repeat himself.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'One builds a lot of relationships over a career covering nearly six decades, and the playwright Terrence McNally, who died of coronavirus complications on Tuesday, could count on an extraordinary number of them. Many of these bonds were distinguished by an enduring loyalty, and they ranged widely in the American performing-arts scene — McNally wrote plays, books for musicals, opera librettos and screenplays. Below are reminiscences from his collaborators and peers. Some were collected by email, others by telephone; they have been edited for length and clarity.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1617, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/25/arts/25mcnally-admirers-1/25mcnally-admirers-1-thumbStand