ren indulge in their favorite foods while riding out the crisis. Plus: resources for food-insecure families.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/26/parenting/coronavirus-kids-cooking.html', 'snippet': 'It’s OK to let children indulge in their favorite foods while riding out the crisis. Plus: resources for food-insecure families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we slog through another week of self-isolation, quarantine or even total lockdown, parents stuck at home with young children are grappling with how to keep everyone well-fed … meal after meal, snack after snack, day after day. I’ve rounded up some common questions and sought answers from two dietitians, a pediatrician and an anti-hunger advocate.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/19/multimedia/26parenting-distancingeating/26parenting-distancingeating-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/19/multimedia/26parenting-distancingeating/26parenting-distancingeating-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/19/multimedia/26parenting-distancingeating/26parenting-distancingeating-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/19/multimedia/26parenting-distancingeating/26parenting-distancingeating-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1167, 'width': 1750, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/19/multimedia/26parenting-distancingeating/26parenting-distancingea