ice vote, highly unusual for such consequential legislation. But the plan could collapse if even one lawmaker objects.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/27/us/politics/stimulus-package-voice-vote.html', 'snippet': 'Leaders in both parties were hoping to pass the measure by voice vote, highly unusual for such consequential legislation. But the plan could collapse if even one lawmaker objects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The House planned on Friday to use an extraordinary method to push through a $2 trillion stimulus package to respond to the coronavirus pandemic. Leaders in both parties were aiming to pass the measure by a voice vote — highly unusual for such consequential legislation — so that members who were either sick or in quarantine could be spared a trip to Washington to vote in person.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/us/politics/27dc-virus-explainer/merlin_170974866_f8cbb8bf-5711-49cf-a3e0-8dfcae184c3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/27/us/politics/27dc-virus-explainer/merlin_170974866_f8cbb8bf-5711-49cf-a3e0-8dfcae184c3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/us/politics/27dc-virus-explainer/merlin_170974866_f8cbb8bf-5711-49cf-a3e0-8dfcae184c3c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/us/politics/27dc-virus-explainer/merlin_170974866_f8cbb8bf-5711-49cf-a3e0-8dfcae184c3c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 