le/f2266546-2a30-5d37-a420-7fa65cf00758'}, {'abstract': 'When I went to Europe, people asked: Is something wrong with American dogs? The answer has more to do with us than our pets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/27/smarter-living/dog-training-behavior.html', 'snippet': 'When I went to Europe, people asked: Is something wrong with American dogs? The answer has more to do with us than our pets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I traveled in Europe, specifically England, Germany, France and the Netherlands, I noticed an intense difference in the way dogs were treated and integrated into society compared to the United States. Quite simply, dogs were everywhere: restaurants and buses and performance venues and countless other places.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/smarter-living/00sl-eurodogs/00sl-eurodogs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/26/smarter-living/00sl-eurodogs/00sl-eurodogs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/smarter-living/00sl-eurodogs/00sl-eurodogs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/smarter-living/00sl-eurodogs/00sl-eurodogs-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1350, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/26/smarter-living/00sl-eurodogs/00sl-eurodogs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images