hut down and other industry disruptions, some of the most anticipated titles of the spring are being pushed back to later in the year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/27/books/publishing-industry-setbacks-virus.html', 'snippet': 'With stores temporarily shut down and other industry disruptions, some of the most anticipated titles of the spring are being pushed back to later in the year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Months ago, in what now feels like another era, publishers planning their 2020 schedules hoped to avoid releasing books in the fall, typically the industry’s biggest season. Editors and writers worried that new releases would be lost in the deluge of political news leading up to the presidential election, so publishers jammed some of their biggest titles into the spring.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/books/27publishingsetbacks1/merlin_170597373_89a5b136-6888-4591-8127-f741294c5562-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/27/books/27publishingsetbacks1/merlin_170597373_89a5b136-6888-4591-8127-f741294c5562-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/books/27publishingsetbacks1/merlin_170597373_89a5b136-6888-4591-8127-f741294c5562-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/books/27publishingsetbacks1/merlin_170597373_89a5b136-6888-4591-8127-f741294c5562-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'ca