50c2-b752-fc84809acfe1'}, {'abstract': 'If summer is to bring any sense of normalcy, the country’s leaders must act quickly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/30/opinion/coronavirus-reopen-america.html', 'snippet': 'If summer is to bring any sense of normalcy, the country’s leaders must act quickly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three months into a global pandemic that is straining the fabric of America’s society, political leaders say that the nation is facing a stark choice between economic prosperity and the preservation of human life. Andrew Cuomo, the governor of New York, has given voice to the sentiments of many by insisting that every life is priceless and that the government must be prepared to sacrifice prosperity to prevent deaths. “We will not put a dollar figure on human life,” he declared.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How America Can Reopen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How America Can Reopen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ventilators (Medical)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Protective Clothing and Gear', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-03-30T09:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/a86