_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c8d9476-8496-5b5a-9710-a41eb6867c7c', 'word_count': 615, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c8d9476-8496-5b5a-9710-a41eb6867c7c'}, {'abstract': 'The pandemic has disrupted relations among the masses, the elites and the celebrities who liaise between them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/30/arts/virus-celebrities.html', 'snippet': 'The pandemic has disrupted relations among the masses, the elites and the celebrities who liaise between them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'America is in crisis, but the celebrities are thriving. They are beaming into our homes, reminding us to stay indoors and “stay positive,” as “we’re all in this together.” When I watch their selfie public service announcements, I find my attention drifting to the edges of the frame: to the understated wall molding visible behind Robert DeNiro’s shoulder; to the Craftsman beams on Priyanka Chopra’s balcony; to the equine wallpaper framing Zoë Kravitz’s crackling fireplace.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/31/arts/30virus-celebrity/30virus-celebrity-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/31/arts/30virus-celebrity/30virus-celebrity-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/31/arts/30virus-celebrity/30virus-celebrity-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/31/arts/30virus-celebrity/30virus-celebrity-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1477, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 