Subway use has plummeted in recent weeks, but in poorer areas of New York City, many people are still riding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/03/30/nyregion/coronavirus-mta-subway-riders.html', 'snippet': 'Subway use has plummeted in recent weeks, but in poorer areas of New York City, many people are still riding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the coronavirus pandemic has all but shut down New York City, its subway — an emblem of urban overcrowding — has become almost unrecognizable, with overall ridership down 87 percent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/03/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30/00nyvirus-subwayNEW30-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight