 laboratory,” she says one mild morning in February. “I’m always bringing in new pieces of art or chairs or accessories.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/05/t-magazine/design/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5/30-tmag-wearstler-slide-3JS5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cro